  "payload": {
    "subject": "修复 getDefaultTheme stub 返回空对象导致 CSS 变量缺失、按钮空白",
    "context": "#004",
    "content": "## 问题\n\n按钮 DOM 已渲染（权限检查通过），但显示空白，样式失效。\n\n## 根因\n\n`util.js` stub 的 `getDefaultTheme` 在 localStorage 无数据时返回 `{}`：\n\n```javascript\ngetDefaultTheme: function() {\n    return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"theme\") || \"null\") || {};\n}\n```\n\n但 `applyThemeToTarget` (appContext.js:200-220) 需要 `theme.options` 来生成 CSS 变量：\n\n```javascript\napplyThemeToTarget(win, theme) {\n    let options = theme.options;  // undefined → 循环失败 → 无 CSS 变量\n    for (let option in options) {\n        styleContent += `--${option}: ${options[option]};`;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nLayuiVue 按钮依赖 `--colorPrimary`、`--colorTextPrimary` 等 CSS 变量渲染颜色，无变量 = 空白按钮。\n\n## 修复\n\n`getDefaultTheme` 提供最小默认主题（参照 themes.js turquoise 主题）：\n\n```javascript\n// 改前\ngetDefaultTheme: function() {\n    return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"theme\") || \"null\") || {};\n}\n\n// 改后\ngetDefaultTheme: function() {\n    return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"theme\") || \"null\") || {\n        options: {\n            colorPrimary: \"#16BAAA\",\n            colorTextPrimary: \"#FFFFFF\",\n            colorTextSecondary: \"#FFFFFF\",\n            colorMenuActive: \"#00000055\",\n            colorMenuText: \"#EEEEEE\",\n            colorMenuTextActive: \"#EEEEEE\",\n            colorProgress: \"red\",\n            colorBodyBackground: \"#FFFFFF\",\n            colorBodyText: \"#333333\",\n            colorSecondary: \"color-mix(in srgb, var(--colorPrimary) 80%, white)\"\n        }\n    };\n}\n```",
    "files": [
      "caikuangzi.fenluwebproject/trunk/Web/Web/v2/util.js"
    ],
    "actions": [
      "util.js getAppContext() stub 的 getDefaultTheme 补充默认 theme options",
      "SVN 暂存",
      "发送 REVIEW 给 Reviewer"
    ],
    "deadline": null
  }
}
